      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-02-03_WidnesExaminer_art0061" n="art0061">
        <head>HELLTH COMMITTER.</head>
        <p>HELLTH COMMITTER.</p>
        <p>This Commi!t,e r3comeneaded—:nat Joseph Gibson, N. 59,Surrey street,b3 regiitereo as a purveyor of milk and tnat the tender of Mr Willi im Mallor to supply pro- vender for the next six months be accPptcl. Mr. T. Dean proposed and Mr. G. Heytitt seconded the adoption of the Health Cornmitte3's nport,which was carried.</p>
