        <p>Every person's future is to a certain extent in his own hand. Many a future which might have been brit- lent has been darkened by lack of timely preparation to meet the exigencies and changes which occur in every day life. Many a home which might have been glad- dened by life alai health, and comfort,has been saddened by poverty, illness, and death, in many cases wholly preventable. There are, indeed, few that dc not feel the system needs recruiting after the treiag feeling of lassitude, with others, "not quite up to the mark." "a. sort of all over sinking feeling," "toe weak to do any- thing about the house," "these recurring headed:les," "no appetite for my food," etc. These. and a dozen others, are common expressions which all point to the urgent need of some good tonic mixture, a reliable me- dicine of established reputation and of proved virtue. There are several tonic mixtures to be Dad, but none which have been so uniformly successful as Ciwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters; it has never been known to fail. It's always the same, there can be no mistake about it. The careful preparation and a manipulation of manufacture under the most stringent rules, assures the certainty that Gwilym Evans' Qainine Bitters, the Vegetable Tenic, is always efficacious and genuinely Successful in all cases of Indigestioa,Weakness,Nervous- nese, Low Spirits, Sleeplessness, Dyspepsia, Liver Com- plaints, Neuralgia, and Influerza. We claim that Gwilym Evans's Quinine Bitters is a General Benefactor of Suf- fering Humanity. Hundreds of testimonials prove this, coming from all classes of the community. Pain is no respector of persons, be advised, try Gwilyna Evans' Quinine Bitters,a sovereign remedy for various ailments, for rich and poor alike. When you buy Gwilym Evans' Quinine Bitters, you get what you think you get, abee- lutely the Tonic of Natures own providing, comprised of the beneficient properties contained in Sarsaparilla, Saffron, Gentian, Burdock, Lavender, and Dand