      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-02-03_WidnesExaminer_art0079" n="art0079">
        <head>FRIDAY, FEBRUARY 3, 18i9.</head>
        <p>FRIDAY, FEBRUARY 3, 18i9.</p>
        <p>RUGBY FOOTBALL.</p>
        <p>H"GRTOORGIGRII. UnY LIIIINO TIBIM FOR 18s. ed.— , of 36 and 33, Queen Victoria street, London, make an ingenious set of arrange- ents whereby a g0.).1 gin 3 of kiiiiiirds eta be played on an dinary dining ttble.</p>
        <p>The &amp;Unit; are easily fixed, and do no damage to the table Theprice includes everything required to play the game. As • the locLlSt.orts Dealer for deier.ptive pamphlet.— Advt. (4)k</p>
