      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-02-03_WidnesExaminer_art0122" n="art0122">
        <p>t Mac:, to tl3e</p>
        <p>NOTICE TO CORRESPONDENTS.</p>
        <p>Authors of letters intended tor publication must in all cases senl their names aud addresses to tie Editor. Matter intended fir publication must be written on one side only of the paper. Corresp3odents are strongly advised to wets briefly. A short letter has much greater chance of weer:ion than / along one.</p>
